On Friday 04 June 2004 21:02 Thomas Wesley Hinton
(wesleyREMOVETHIS@worldonline.dk) wrote:

> Is there a way to decide the race of pet I start a game with.

Yes; put OPTIONS=pettype:cat or OPTIONS=pettype:horse in your .nethackrc
(I think it's called defaults.nh in some operating systems).

If you do that, only some character classes will start with a dog
(Samurai and Ranger, I think).

You can also specify OPTIONS=pettype:none to start with no pet at all.

